  "title": "Reject the fixed 16-column SIMD GEMM variant",
  "status": "rejected",
  "reason": "The fixed 16-column variant provided no clear request-latency gain. Paired ratios were 1.0156 for Q8_0 and 1.0054 for F16, while the unchanged Q4_K control shifted to 0.9728. Target product timings regressed; small request differences are not isolated causal estimates.",
